		<description><![CDATA[Ashok, as I remember his name, was a man of great heart.  I was a guest in his home in New Mexico on my way to Lama way back in the late 1970s. I will never forget the breakfast he and his lady took me for at a great roadhouse sort of establishment.  There was much heart and much laughter!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Ashok, as I remember his name, was a man of great heart.  I was a guest in his home in New Mexico on my way to Lama way back in the late 1970s. I will never forget the breakfast he and his lady took me for at a great roadhouse sort of establishment.  There was much heart and much laughter!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
